      "id": "electron-performance-startup",
      "title": "启动性能：分段埋点与冷启动优化",
      "outcome": "能拆解主进程启动各阶段耗时，能用 --trace-startup 录启动 trace，能识别同步初始化阻塞事件循环的位置",
      "chapter_refs": [
        "docs/part3-engineering/18-performance.md",
        "docs/part1-background/05-lifecycle.md"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "electron-testing",
      "title": "Electron 测试：Vitest + Playwright _electron",
      "outcome": "能用三层测试策略（单元/集成/E2E），能用 Playwright _electron 启动真实应用做 IPC 与窗口契约测试",
      "chapter_refs": [
        "docs/part3-engineering/17-testing.md"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "electron-cicd",
      "title": "CI/CD 与无头测试（xvfb + 三平台矩阵）",
      "outcome": "能写出 GitHub Actions 三平台矩阵 workflow，理解 xvfb 的作用，能用 --no-sandbox 解决 Linux 容器沙箱问题",
      "chapter_refs": [
        "docs/part3-engineering/22-cicd.md"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "electron-versioning",
      "title": "Electron 版本策略与升级清单",
      "outcome": "能解释 SemVer 在 Electron 中的实际含义，能列出 3 条支持线、EOL 日期，能写出升级前检查清单与回滚预案",
      "chapter_refs": [
        "docs/appendix/versioning.md"
